### Get Reproductive Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Reproductive Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/1/reproductive-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isPregnant": true,
  "lastPeriodDate": "2025-09-01",
  "averageCycleLength": 28
}
